@startuml game_window_lantern_additions

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    -- Added Fields --
    - obj: Entity[] = new Entity[30]

    -- Relevant Methods --
    + getPlayer(): Player
    + getObj(): Entity[]
    + repaint(): void
  }
}

package asset {
  class AssetSetter {
    -- Added Methods --
    + setObjLantern(): void
  }
}

package entity {
  class Entity {
    + getWorldX(): int
    + getWorldY(): int
    + isLightSource(): boolean
  }
}

asset.AssetSetter --> window.GameWindow : uses / populates obj array
window.GameWindow --> entity.Entity : manages (obj array)

note right of window.GameWindow
**Notes**
- オブジェクト配列フィールド obj をサイズ 30 で追加し、ワールド内のオブジェクトを保持します。
- AssetSetter.setObjLantern() は ObjLantern を生成して GameWindow.obj に配置する責務を持ちます。

- Added an object array field `obj` sized to 30 to hold world objects.
- `AssetSetter.setObjLantern()` is responsible for creating and placing ObjLantern into `GameWindow.obj`.
end note

@enduml